{"versions":[{"path":"versions/ce1341a3-beb4-45fa-a869-0da3366cf5d5/4eda44a97484ad42bd0e393346901829689b9f9525500e6df4c8276801dde375.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"ce1341a3-beb4-45fa-a869-0da3366cf5d5","revision":"sha256:4eda44a97484ad42bd0e393346901829689b9f9525500e6df4c8276801dde375","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"What makes the time complexity analysis of a backtracking algorithm very difficult is that the number of solutions that do satisfy the restriction is hard to estimate."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"d368095d-8cec-4151-87c6-48c2fa64a0c3"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"6784e8f0-0f59-4c7b-a64a-b788c0dd2981"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"可行部分解的数量受约束与输入影响, 通常难以事先估计, 因而回溯时间分析困难"}]}}},{"path":"versions/fd22088a-5155-43fa-9ee4-85e6272b4e99/544a26d3b6815d67b420b136c9a4a96e5164b6d12b0180d4d5b73284df8b06cf.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"fd22088a-5155-43fa-9ee4-85e6272b4e99","revision":"sha256:544a26d3b6815d67b420b136c9a4a96e5164b6d12b0180d4d5b73284df8b06cf","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Making $N$ insertions into an initally empty binomial queue takes $\\Theta (N log N)$ time in the worst case."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"f9de752c-735b-47d0-8599-707356db77e5"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"5ea66518-3cd0-447d-bd0d-0f63ed49dbca"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"连续插入的总链接次数为 $N-\\operatorname{popcount}(N)$, 总时间为 $\\Theta(N)$"}]}}},{"path":"versions/1a32cf37-a440-494c-87f8-093a3da6f875/16b8116b8184c32a280698106a4b686236b7eb0867e6655de5a88e0d1fda3972.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"1a32cf37-a440-494c-87f8-093a3da6f875","revision":"sha256:16b8116b8184c32a280698106a4b686236b7eb0867e6655de5a88e0d1fda3972","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"In the 4-queens problem, ($x_1$, $x_2$, $x_3$, $x_4$) correspond to the 4 queens' column indices. During backtracking, (1, 4, 2, ?) will be checked before (2, 4, 1, ?), and none of them has any solution in their branches."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"c61fe1d9-a507-47f4-99f1-0b0d1234e317"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"50790690-21d6-44f1-9b43-c07bff45d75a"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"$(2,4,1,3)$ 是合法四皇后解, 因此第二个前缀有解"}]}}},{"path":"versions/fd76d054-3253-46e8-a5ad-011178752f4e/986610d5eaa0e9da2b6ecf6499cd64ad2cb2ebd94d393091d5b115ebcf4304ee.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"fd76d054-3253-46e8-a5ad-011178752f4e","revision":"sha256:986610d5eaa0e9da2b6ecf6499cd64ad2cb2ebd94d393091d5b115ebcf4304ee","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"It is guaranteed that an exhaustive search can always find the solution in finite time."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"a2d5f155-2531-4f58-87a5-22351ec0b919"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"0c362fb5-6b34-416f-95a1-82b463ab5460"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"有限候选集中的有解实例可以通过穷举找到解; 对无解实例或无限搜索空间, 题述保证不成立"}]}}},{"path":"versions/0ca0825d-5091-4c55-864c-54ce5173125e/b9270ee02ed19ee343e19ab4caa251f51058e053e6d2f908e15dc2bf2e36de7a.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"0ca0825d-5091-4c55-864c-54ce5173125e","revision":"sha256:b9270ee02ed19ee343e19ab4caa251f51058e053e6d2f908e15dc2bf2e36de7a","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Inserting a number into a binomial heap with 11 nodes costs more time than inserting a number into a binomial heap with 17 nodes."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"72a806e6-8058-43a0-90fd-34754694837c"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"9fcf76a3-efe6-4160-a4cb-53becb25ee76"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"11 的二进制末尾有两个 1, 标准插入需链接两次; 17 末尾只有一个 1, 需链接一次"}]}}},{"path":"versions/97508cc2-8197-4e31-9384-fc80984e5313/56a6b1a3ff2e53a928fc1cd8039a23f95718604fbb7ca0562e275d9b5a033752.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"97508cc2-8197-4e31-9384-fc80984e5313","revision":"sha256:56a6b1a3ff2e53a928fc1cd8039a23f95718604fbb7ca0562e275d9b5a033752","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Given the following game tree, the red node will be pruned with α-β pruning algorithm if and only if __."},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/162c531c7b16a38ee0e9c36e5eeafeda67e9ccf2c94468cfb13b2a9c8a5da4ae.jpg","alt":"bt.jpg"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"$6 \\leq x\\leq13$","correct":false,"option_id":"e6caf8b4-c16c-4c58-913b-4d1e4819ee95"},{"type":"text","content":"$x\\geq9$","correct":true,"option_id":"a7db26cd-9248-4b4e-800d-094ffb198d2e"},{"type":"text","content":"$x\\geq13$","correct":false,"option_id":"9292360f-f52a-4598-999c-5f58a9b7cbfb"},{"type":"text","content":"$6 \\leq x\\leq9$","correct":false,"option_id":"a5404791-fc09-4ebb-8b1c-ea7c61db53e0"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"从左到右搜索, 右侧 min 节点先读到 9; 传入的 $\\alpha=\\max(6,\\min(13,x))$, 当 $9\\le\\alpha$ 即 $x\\ge9$ 时可以剪枝"}]}}},{"path":"versions/525924c8-55eb-4368-b8fd-703b70f6b823/13da6cc07991c44742c20ac37c5ff48bdcf8a244744364f105e94b489f93567a.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"525924c8-55eb-4368-b8fd-703b70f6b823","revision":"sha256:13da6cc07991c44742c20ac37c5ff48bdcf8a244744364f105e94b489f93567a","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Delete the minimum number from the given binomial queues in the following figure. Which one of the following statements must be FALSE?"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/c0b600196f9d078e02992330ca8eaa9ac245ee760d5815b62f10e8167f762630.jpg","alt":"133.jpg"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"if 9 is a child of 4, then 15 must be the root of $B_1$","correct":false,"option_id":"da815f3c-afc0-4fff-b759-b727d6067d3b"},{"type":"text","content":"9 can never be the root of any resulting binomial tree","correct":true,"option_id":"275a0fad-813a-45b3-98fc-812adb4e834f"},{"type":"text","content":"16 and 15 can be the children of 4","correct":false,"option_id":"7d2faf66-d426-4589-b684-73da1a998337"},{"type":"text","content":"there are two binomial trees after deletion, which are $B_1$ and $B_2$","correct":false,"option_id":"2bb9371a-f3ff-4dec-908b-3ec95dbbaaa1"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"删除最小值后, 一种合法合并结果以 9 为 $B_2$ 的根"}]}}},{"path":"versions/62d47a8e-9e70-413f-a913-c5047f043340/f7e3fbcf28ceb4b1a5a1ccae2dd2407c4c7977a7850082ee8f50b954155a8fd9.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"62d47a8e-9e70-413f-a913-c5047f043340","revision":"sha256:f7e3fbcf28ceb4b1a5a1ccae2dd2407c4c7977a7850082ee8f50b954155a8fd9","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"To solve the turnpike reconstruction problem with given distances {1,1,3,3,4,4,4,5,7,8},which of the following statements is true?"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"x1=0, x2=1, x3=5","correct":false,"option_id":"0ccdba89-02b2-48f6-a3e4-18af6bf576da"},{"type":"text","content":"x3=4, x4=6, x5=8","correct":false,"option_id":"ba184b5c-873a-4b6b-b2c9-9e62bc283f3a"},{"type":"text","content":"x1=0, x3=4, x5=8","correct":true,"option_id":"8a24388f-cdc3-4575-8bc7-a3647946a9ab"},{"type":"text","content":"x1=0, x2=3, x3=5","correct":false,"option_id":"12297a28-b8a8-4a2c-8024-649dc330be4d"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"符合距离多重集的两组点为 $(0,1,4,5,8)$ 和 $(0,3,4,7,8)$, 均满足 $x_1=0,x_3=4,x_5=8$"}]}}},{"path":"versions/8b5b48a0-9f1d-4a11-97c2-841ef42dda89/6fde113b578b050c729d6900a5cd25de22b906557bc0bb516e0ac1bda0f51546.json","value":{"schema_version":3,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"8b5b48a0-9f1d-4a11-97c2-841ef42dda89","revision":"sha256:6fde113b578b050c729d6900a5cd25de22b906557bc0bb516e0ac1bda0f51546","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Given the following game tree, if node b is pruned with α-β pruning algorithm, which of the following statements about the value of node a is correct?"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/a13af83a2f883cfb5f38b4373a9943899570fa50dc0884eb0d357b07f3960126.jpg","alt":"a-b剪枝-1.jpg"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"less than 65","correct":false,"option_id":"cbf0fe80-8cb8-40d5-983c-e2ae3902e974"},{"type":"text","content":"less than 68","correct":false,"option_id":"35595fa6-bcae-4e18-95e6-44d4496240ec"},{"type":"text","content":"greater than 65","correct":false,"option_id":"ceab3e73-6196-4ac0-b472-78842aa19e81"},{"type":"text","content":"greater than 68","correct":false,"option_id":"c4a4afd7-7f03-415f-b37c-a08b4c0f1bb4"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"按允许等号的 $\\alpha$-$\\beta$ 剪枝, 当 $a\\ge68$ 时可剪去 b。题目的 greater than 68 排除了 $a=68$ 的情况, 选项存在争议"}],"answer_status":"unavailable","selection_mode":"single"}}},{"path":"versions/a7f450cd-5d16-4b07-8b40-9ad178d949e3/8e69906c4786d4a9b7c97968a9ff61827936d6d750437f675e0993d62e9368e7.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"a7f450cd-5d16-4b07-8b40-9ad178d949e3","revision":"sha256:8e69906c4786d4a9b7c97968a9ff61827936d6d750437f675e0993d62e9368e7","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Given the distance set D={1,1,2,2,2,2,3,3,3,4,5,5,6,6,8} in a Turnpike Reconstruction problem, first it can be sure that x1=0 and x6=8. Which of the following possible solutions will be checked next?"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"x2=1, x5=5","correct":false,"option_id":"6b515096-0e37-42c8-98c6-d320d5725e45"},{"type":"text","content":"x2=2, x5=6","correct":true,"option_id":"36da7ae9-02cf-431b-a78d-8a458e83c8d6"},{"type":"text","content":"x2=1, x5=6","correct":false,"option_id":"e89cf51b-2e0a-4a44-a69c-8c167df30308"},{"type":"text","content":"x3=3, x5=6","correct":false,"option_id":"88f8d319-a82c-46a4-ac69-8a25931fb97e"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"按右端优先先试 $x_5=6$, 再试 $x_2=2$, 该部分解通过距离检查。原题距离集无完整重建解, 这里只判断下一步候选"}]}}},{"path":"versions/af24fe88-953c-49da-8688-4cb75827ca7b/71f8078946adfc28d5785fed470c8fbc49977e93ba407e19736296a658b3763c.json","value":{"schema_version":3,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"af24fe88-953c-49da-8688-4cb75827ca7b","revision":"sha256:71f8078946adfc28d5785fed470c8fbc49977e93ba407e19736296a658b3763c","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"BinQueue_Find\nThe functions BinQueue_Find and Recur_Find are to find X in a binomial queue H.  Return the node pointer if found, otherwise return NULL."},{"type":"code","content":"BinTree BinQueue_Find( BinQueue H, ElementType X )\n{\n    BinTree T, result = NULL;\n    int i, j; \n\n    for( i=0, j=1; j<=H->CurrentSize; i++, j*=2) {  /* for each tree in H */\n        T= H->TheTrees[i];\n        if ( X ____(1)____ ){  /* if need to search inside this tree */\n            result = Recur_Find(T, X);\n            if ( result != NULL ) return result;\n        } \n    }\n    return result;\n}\n\nBinTree Recur_Find( BinTree T, ElementType X )\n{\n    BinTree result = NULL;\n    if ( X==T->Element ) return T;\n    if ( T->LeftChild!=NULL ){\n        result = Recur_Find(T->LeftChild, X);\n        if ( result!=NULL ) return result;\n    } \n    if ( ____(2)____ )\n        result = Recur_Find(T->NextSibling, X);\n    return result;\n}","language":"c"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"(1) `>= (T != NULL ? T->Element : X) && T != NULL`\n(2) `T->NextSibling != NULL`"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"先检查树槽位是否为空, 再根据最小堆的根值判断是否查找; 子树未找到时继续搜索兄弟"}],"response":{"fields":[{"id":"blank1","label":"第 1 空","kind":"text","blank":"____(1)____"},{"id":"blank2","label":"第 2 空","kind":"text","blank":"____(2)____"}]}}}}]}